@host = https://localhost:7124

### GET With API Key (200)
GET {{host}}/api/Tickets
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET Without API Key (401)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/
Accept: application/json

### OpenApi Document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Unknown URL
GET {{host}}/api/get-a-free-iphone
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET by ID 0 (400)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/0
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET by ID -1 (400)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/-1
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### GET by ID 1 (200)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### POST ticket ID 2
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 2,
  "user": "sandra",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z",
  "description": "Printer is broken"
}

### POST ticket ID 3
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 3,
  "user": "sandra",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z",
  "description": "No network"
}

### POST ticket ID 4
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 4,
  "user": "sandra",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z",
  "description": "Monitor flickers"
}

### POST Without Description
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 5,
  "user": "sandra",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"
}

### GET Diagnostics (operation ID)
GET {{host}}/api/Diagnostics
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test Endpoint that throws
GET {{host}}/api/Diagnostics/throw
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}